  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"0.9.6\"\n\npackage:\n  name: libcap-ng\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/stevegrubb/libcap-ng/archive/refs/tags/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 399040138e0ca62fa2bcabd63da9af4431a246ef7a654561a0ca3cb00010a539\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  script:\n    - ./autogen.sh\n    # NOTE: we `--disable-cap-audit` since it requires `bpftool`, `libaudit` and `libbpf` which aren't yet packaged for conda-forge\n    - ./configure --prefix=\"$PREFIX\" --disable-static --disable-cap-audit --without-python3\n    - make -j${CPU_COUNT}\n    - make install\n    - rm -f \"$PREFIX\"/lib/*.la\n  skip: not linux\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - autoconf\n    - automake\n    - libtool\n    - make\n    - pkg-config\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - filecap -d\n      - netcap\n      - pscap\n  - package_contents:\n      bin:\n        - filecap\n        - netcap\n        - pscap\n      include:\n        - cap-ng.h\n      lib:\n        - cap-ng\n        - drop_ambient\n      files:\n        - lib/pkgconfig/libcap-ng.pc\n        - share/aclocal/cap-ng.m4\n        - share/bash-completion/completions/cap-audit\n        - share/bash-completion/completions/filecap\n        - share/bash-completion/completions/libcap-ng.bash_completion\n        - share/bash-completion/completions/netcap\n        - share/bash-completion/completions/pscap\n        - share/man/man3/*.3\n        - share/man/man7/*.7\n        - share/man/man8/*.8\n      strict: true\n\nabout:\n  summary: A library that makes using POSIX capabilities easier\n  description: |\n    Libcap-ng is a library that makes programming with POSIX capabilities easier.\n    It also provides utilities for analyzing the capabilities of running processes\n    and files, including `filecap`, `netcap`, and `pscap`.\n  license: LGPL-2.1-or-later AND GPL-2.0-or-later\n  license_file:\n    - COPYING\n    - COPYING.LIB\n  homepage: https://people.redhat.com/sgrubb/libcap-ng/\n  documentation: https://github.com/stevegrubb/libcap-ng/tree/master/docs\n  repository: https://github.com/stevegrubb/libcap-ng\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - salim-b\n",
